<h1>Affiliate disclosure</h1>
<p class="lede">Some links on this site may be affiliate links. If you buy through them, the site may earn a commission, at no extra cost to you.</p>
<p>This never changes which alarm a page recommends, because recommendations come from manufacturer compatibility information.</p>
<p>As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases.</p>
<p>Retailer partners may include Amazon, Walmart, Ace Hardware, Home Depot, and X-Sense.</p>
<p>Numbered citations on a page are links to alarm makers, NFPA, USFA and CPSC. Those are references, not store links.</p>
